      "writtenOn": "2024-08-26T23:27:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Why do we need to use this specific function ? It seems weird to use an `AsUser` method in a system stack.\n\nTwo things here:\n\n* First, is the Broadcast receiver correctly configured to receive an intent sent with `sendBroadcast` ? \n* The Telecom team is currently under a pretty big refactor, did you test with their flag to on and check if the issue still exist ?",
